        "subtype": "bot_message",
        "text": "*[Bug 18680] Transparent lines show dark points*\n<https:\/\/bugs.r-project.org\/show_bug.cgi?id=18680>\n\n--- Comment #6 from Tomek Gieorgijewski (<mailto:cybergeorge2020@gmail.com|cybergeorge2020@gmail.com>) ---\nDuring R Dev Day 2026 in Warsaw we managed to find a workaround of this obvious\nApple's bug. \nI'm sending the patch but possibly Simon has something even more up-to-date.\n\nThe patch avoids the bug by creating polygon path from multiline path to avoid\nwrong rendering of the latter. \n`CGPathCreateCopyByStrokingPath`function is used for that\nBefore that we also take into the account dashing of the line which is affected\nby the bug (dash's phase resets every 127 lines). For that we use\n`CGPathCreateCopyByDashingPath`",
        "username": "r-bugs notifier",
        "icons": {
            "emoji": ":robot_face:"
        },
